			"notes": "# Hypixel Old Symbols 1.3.0\n\n##Features\n\n- Client-side Fabric mod for reverting Hypixel's newer custom symbol characters back to older ASCII-style replacements.\n- Config file to add own symbols/phrases to the replacement list\n- disabled Farming Fortune, Mining Fortune, Foraging Fortune and Hunter Fortune by default in the config file as they might break other mods/farming tracker\n\n- Fixes custom health/mana bar from other mods e.g. SkyblockTweaks"
